# Sandbox → live Grafana

Full runbook: `docs/sandbox-to-live-grafana.md`.

When the user asks to promote sandbox to **live** (`grafana.electramet.com:3000`):

- Merge **Graft + grafana-llm-app + org plugin settings + TIG scripts** only.
- **Never** copy dashboards, Grafana alert rules, `grafana.db`, whole `plugins/`, or `[auth*]` (live has a 2FA plugin).
- Live **peer-RF/ML list starts empty**: `peer_rf_config.json` → `{"machines": {}}`. Do not copy sandbox enrollments or `ml_predictions`.
- Need live SSH (`user@host` + key) before executing. Sandbox remains `ec2-user@35.175.68.13`.
- Provision orgs with Grafana **admin basic auth on localhost in Docker**, not a service-account token (cannot list/switch orgs) and not the 2FA browser login.
- Git branch `reconstruct/build-87` is historical; plugin badge is **build 213+**.
